---
import { siteInfo } from '../data/mock';
---

<section class="section-padding bg-moon-cream">
  <div class="container-moon">
    <div class="reveal grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border-2 border-moon-sand/30">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-moon-olive via-moon-brown to-moon-rust/60"></div>
        <div class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 text-center">
          <span class="text-6xl mb-4" aria-hidden="true">🌙</span>
          <p class="font-display text-2xl italic text-moon-cream/90">Above the city lights,<br />under the moon.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-1 bg-moon-sand"></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-accent text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-moon-sand mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="inline-block h-px w-8 bg-moon-sand" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Our Story
        </p>
        <h2 class="heading-section text-moon-olive mb-6">An elevated escape in the heart of Vizag.</h2>
        <p class="text-moon-olive/75 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Perched on the 4th floor above Westside on VIP Road, Moon Bar & Kitchen is Siripuram's answer to elevated dining and craft cocktails. Multi-cuisine plates, live music Wed–Sun, and views that stretch across Visakhapatnam.
        </p>
        <p class="text-moon-olive/75 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Whether it's a Friday night DJ set, Sunday brunch with mimosas, or a quiet cocktail under the stars — every visit is written in the stars.
        </p>
        <a href="/about" class="btn-olive">Read our story</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
